  "title": "Northeast Brazil is ours",
  "briefing": "Tidewater Consortium holds Northeast Brazil through its switching yard. Reconnect 3 relays, take down the site warden, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, then leave by the exit. Expect 10 enemy agents and 4 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Northeast Brazil Blackout: Tidewater Consortium runs Northeast Brazil from its switching yard, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, silence the warden, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Northeast Brazil wakes up with the switching yard in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Northeast Brazil before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
